<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1 Thessalonica</book>
  <para style="h">1 Thessalonica</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Thessalonica</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Thessalonica</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Thessalonica</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Silvanus, le Timothy-te in, Pa Pasien le Topa Jesu Khris sunga a om Thessalonica khuo hlattuom pawlpite tungah: Note tungah hepina le lungmuonna thupha ang om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I Topa Jesu Khris sungah upna tawh na nasepnate uh, itna tawh na hanciemnate ule lam-etna kip na neinate uh, i Pa Pasien mai-ah hing phawh denin, kote in ka thungetna sung vuah na min uh loin, note zosie adingin lungdamna ka ko zing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in a it sanggamte aw, ama in note ang tel zo lam ka thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note lahah ka op laitahun note adingin bangci bang mi ka hi uh ahei, ci kang lah uh na thei ma bangun, ka gen uh lungdamna thu zong note tungah kam beh tawh hi loin, vanglietna sung le Hlagau siengtho sungah a bukim kithei cienna tawh ang tung ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note in bawlsietna na thuoh vangun Hlagau Siengtho ziehin kipahna tawh Pasien’ thu na sang vua, kote le Topa’ ette mite na suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n note pen Macedonia gam le Achaia gam sunga thu um mite zosie tungah limpha na suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note kung panin Macedonia gam sung le Achaia gam sung teng ah Topa’ kammal a kiza hi beh loin, muncin tengah na Pasien upna uh kithei sieng zo ahi ziehin kang gen ding uh a kisam nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen tua gam sung tenga a om mite in note lahah ko bang ei kici zindo ci thu le, a hing zing le a man Pasien’ na a sem dingin milimte panin Pasien lamah note bangci kihei ci thute le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ang tung ding thangpaina panin ei suohtasah ding pa Jesu, sina pana a thawsahkia, a Tapa vantung pana ang pei ding ngah a na op lam uh ang gen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, na kung vua kang hawna thu a mawhna suoh lo ding hi, ci pen no mama in na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hizongle na theisa ma bangun Philippi khuo ah gimna thuohin zumhuoi tahin ei kibawlsie a, langpanna nasie tahin a op vangin, na kung vuah Pasien’ lungdamna thu a gen dingin i Pasien sungah hansanna ka nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile kote in kang ngetna uh pen zuouthu le ngimna sieng lo pan hi loin, sol bawla zawl ang sawm zong ka hi sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />lungdamna thu a gen dinga Pasien in ei thukimpisa ka hi ma bangun, thu gen nan uleng zong mite lungkim nading hi loin, ka lungtang uh ei sittel Pasien lungdam nadinga a gen ka hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thei ma bangun phatna kamteng tawh hitale kote’ phattuom nading ngaisutna tawh hitale kang pei ngai lo lam uh Pasien ka teci uh ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khris’ sawltahpite bangin thu khatpopo kang kalh thei vangun note tung pan ahi a, midangte tung pan ahi zongin phatna ka sui sih uhi. Tuale mahin nupi naukem khat in a tate nunnemtahin a zen a khoi bangin note lahah ka nunnem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n note kang nah it seng ziehun Pasien’ lungdamna thu beh hi loin, ka hinna mama uzong hop dingin ka khensat va-ia uhi, bangzieh ahei cile ko tungah na it huoi mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, na tung vuah Pasien’ lungdamna thu kang hil lai-un, koima’ vangih ka suo lo nadingun sun le zanin gimpipi-a na ka sep lam na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />No thu um mite tungah ka gamtatna uh bangza-in siengtho-in dih a, mawsah nading om lo hi, ci thu Pasien zong teci ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pa in a tate a bawl bangin note khat ciet kang bawlna na thei ma bangun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama’ gam le a minthanna sungah ang hlanpa Pasien’ deina tawh kituoha na nuntah thei nadingun kang kunkun vua, hanthawnin zong kang thum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note in ko kung pana na zah uh Pasien’ thu na san lai-un, mihingte thugen bang hi loin, no thu um mite sungah zong na a sem Pasien’ thu bang lienin note in pom na hi ziehun kote in zong Pasien tungah nuomthu ka tut zing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile sanggamte aw, note na hi ule Judea gam sunga om, Khris Jesu sunga Pasien’ hlattuom pawlpite’ ette na suoh uhi, azieh pen amate in Jew mite’ bawlsietna a thuoh ma bangun note in zong na mipite’ bawlsietna na thuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale amate in Topa Jesu le kamsangte thatin ko zong ei delmang uhi; amate in Pasien lungkimsah loin mi zosie a langbawl vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gentile-te hutdam nadinga amate kunga ka thu hil ding uh zong ei kham uhi. Tua bangin amate in a mawnate uh a dim zing uhi; ahi vangin a tawpna ah Pasien’ thangpaina in amate a nuaphah veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, kote ka hi ule note tawh, lungtang tawh hi loin tahsa pumpi tawh, bakhat sung i kikhen sungin taga banga nei opsah ciengun kimaituo-a i kimu ding nahpi tahin ka lunggul mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na kung vuah hing haw nuom ka hi ziehun, keima Paul in ka sawm zelzel a, hizongle Satan in ka lampi uh ei khahtan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile i Topa Jesu Khris ang pei ciengin ama mai-ah ka lametna uh, ka kipahna ule ka kisielpi ding uh lukhu bang hi mawh ahei? Note hi lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi hi, note pen ka minthanna ule ka kipahna na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ka thuoh zawh nawn vawt lo ciengun, Athen khuo-a om suoh dingin ka khensat ta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuale na upna uh ang thakhausah ding le ang hanthawn dingin Khris lungdamna thu tangkona ah Pasien’ na ka seppi uh i sanggam pa Timothy kang sawl vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua pen bawlsietnate ziehin koima na linglawn lo nading uh deina ahi hi. Kote ka hi ule tam bang bawlsietna a thuoh dinga laitansa ka hi lam uh na theisa uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tahtahin, note tawh i opton lai-in bawlsietna ka thuoh ding uh kang magensa uh ahi ta bo hi; na thei ma bangun tua bangin ang pieng mintah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami thu hang tawh ka thuoh zawh nawn lo ciengin na upna uh a kan dinga ama kang sawl ahi hi; mi ze-et pa in lam khatpo tawh note hing ze-et in ka sep gimnate uh a mawhna a suo khah ding ka lunghimaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in no kung panin ko kungah Timothy ang tung pan lien ahi a, ama in ko tungah na upna ule nei itna uh lungdamna thu thate ei puoh hi. Note kang munop ma bangun note in limtahin kote ei phawhin nei munopna thu zong ama in ei gen zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, tami thu ziehin lunggimna le bawlsietna ka thuoh hun sungun note’ upna tungtawnin ka na kihenem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa sungah na dinkip suoh nah po uleh tu-in a hing ka hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien mai-ah note ziehin ka lungdamna zosie uh thuhkia nadingin Pasien kungah bangci bangin a kicing lungdamna ko theikia ding ka hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note tawh kimaituo-in upna lamah na kisap popo uh na ngakia thei nadingun sun le zanin nahpi tahin thu ka ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in eite’ Pa mama le i Pasien le i Topa Jesu in na kung vua kang haw thei nading uh ma ei pui taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note kang it bangun note khatlekhat na ki-itna ule mi zosie na itna uh Topa in hing khangsah taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama’ misiengtho zosiete tawh i Topa Jesu ang pei ciengin, ama in i Pasien le i Pa uh mai-ah paubanna na nei lo nadingun siengthona sungah na lungtangte uh hing thakhausah taheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A nukhia penin sanggamte aw, Pasien lungkim nadingin bangci nuntah lei kilawm ding ahei, ci thute ko tung pana na sinsa uh ahi ma bangin (a gamta tahtah na hi ma bangun) na sep semsem nadingun i Topa Jesu minin thumin kang hanthawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note in Topa Jesu tungtawna kang pieh uh thuhilnate na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na siengtho nading uh Pasien’ deina ahi ziehin numei-pasal pahtatna na pel un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note khat ciet in siengthona le zatahna tawh noma’ pumpi ciet bangci uh ding ci thei unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasien a thei lo Gentile-te bangin cilesa lunggulnate-ah na uong seng sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam thute-ah koima a sanggamte tungah khiel sih hinlen a met zong sui sih heh, azieh pen kang magensa ule khau taha kang hilsa uh ma bangin tam thute zosie tungah a thuhkia pa pen Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in a thangtat dinga ei hlat ahi sih a, a siengtho dinga ei hlat ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tam thu a niel mi poma pen mihing thuneina a niel hi loin, note tungah ama’ Hlagau Siengtho ang pie pa Pasien a niel ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin sanggam ki-itna tawh kisai-in mi khatpo in note tungah lai tawh ang giel ding na kisam nawn sih uhi, azieh pen khatlekhat na ki-it nadingun Pasien in note mama ang hil zo ta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaci’n note in Macedonia gam kuoma om sanggamte zosie zong na it tahpi uhi. Ahi vangin ka itte aw, tua banga na it semsem ding uh kang hanthawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kang hilsa ma bangun daitaha hinkhuo na man thei nadingun noma vai behah buoi unlen, na khut utawh hanciemin na sem un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tua hile a pulam mite mai-ah kilawmtahin na gamta thei ding vua, koima tungah na kingam ta sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hizongle sanggamte aw, lametna a nei lo midangte banga na da luot lo nadingun a sisa mite thu thei lo-a na op ding uh ka dei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile eite in Jesu si-in thokia zo hi, ci-in i up ma bangin, Jesu tungtawnin Pasien in a sisa mite nangawn zong Jesu tawh ang zawpi ding hi, ci-in i um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen kote in na kung vuah Topa’ kammal kang tangko uh thu in, Topa ang pei cieng dong a nungta a omlai eite in a sisa mite i makhel vawt sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile tua Topa mama, thupiehna awging tawh, vantungmi mangpa kikona le Pasien’ pengkul aw tawh ang kum suh ding a, Khris sungah a sisa mite ang tho masa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin a nungta a omlai eite i hi ule Topa tawh hui lahah a kimu dingin amate tawh meii tungah ei kilato ding a, tuaci’n Topa tawh i omton den ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note khatlekhat tami thute tawh na kihenem un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, tu-in a ni le a hun tawh kisai-in bang khatpo gielpieh na ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile zanlai-a guta bangin Topa’ ni ang tun ding noma ma in na theitelsa uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in, “Kilemna le lungmuonna om hi,” a ci laitahun numei gai khat takei natna in a tut bangin amate tungah thakhatin sietna tung ding a, a suohta koima a om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin no kang itte aw, khuomiel sunga om na hi lo ziehun tua ni in guta bangin ang phawng sih ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />azieh pen note zosie khuovah tate le sunlai tate na hi uhi; eite pen zanlai tate ahi sihle khuomiel tate i hi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin midangte bangin kimu loin, khangloin pilvangin om vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen a kimu mite zanin kimu a, zukham mite in zanlai-in zu a kham uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hizongle sunlai tate i hi lang kalsie uh pilvangin upna le itna awmdal bulin, sialukhu bangin i lamet uh hutdamna khu vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile eite pen Pasien in a thangpaina thuoh dinga ei laitan ahi sih a, i Topa Jesu Khris tungtawnin hutdamna nga dinga ei laitansa i hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eite i khanglo a, i kimu zongin ama tawh i hinton thei nadingin eite adinga ama ang si ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-a na bawl bang lienun note khatlekhat kihanthawnin na kilamkip ciet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin sanggamte aw, noma lahah nasep a pawnthaw mite, Topa sungah ang cingte le ang thuhil mite na zatah nadingun kang thum uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a nasepna uh ziehin itna sungah amate nahpitahin na thupi bawl un. Nomate lahah zong kilemna na omsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kang itte aw, mi thasiete thu hil unlen, a lungneu mite tha pie-in, a thanem mite panpi a, amate zosie tungah na lungsau nadingun kang hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Koima khat beh in sietna pen sietna ma tawh thuhkia loin, khatlekhat tung le mi zosie tungah na hoi sep ding hanciemin na nei zingzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lungdam zing unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />thu ngen zing un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a pieng na vannuoi-ah lungdamna ko un; azieh pen tua khu note adinga Khris Jesu sungah Pasien’ deina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hlagau na sumit sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kamsangte’ gen thute simmawbawl sih unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />sil bangkim sittel pha un; thu hoite na tukip un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />sietna namkim pel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lungmuonna Pasien mama in note hing siengthosah sinsen hinlen, i Topa Jesu Khris ang pei ciengin na hlagau uh, na lungsim ule na pumpi uh nuol bei-in hing kem taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Note ang hlan pa Pasien muonhuoi a, ama in tua khu ang sem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kang itte aw, kote adingin thu ei ngetpieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A siengtho kinapna tawh sanggamte zosie na noset un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate zosie tungah tami kang laihlah na sim un, ci-in Topa’ min tawh lipkhap tahin thu kang pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />I Topa Jesu Khris’ hepina note tawh hing om taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
